      "value": "<p>As&nbsp;song of the cosmos, except as noted above, and creatures that fail their Will saves are also @UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.conditions.Item.YjE6UGzwOTfO9p4g]{Dazzled} for the duration.</p>\n<h2>@UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.spells.Item.ZsRv2Vcl2iamrcCt]{Song Of The Cosmos}</h2>\n<p>You thrum a discordant tune that underlies existence and hints at the deep secrets of the universe. Creatures in the area must succeed at a Will saving throw or be fascinated for the duration.</p>"
